# Voyage 13: Phase 6. The station counter, the stores, the mission board and the
# settings sheet, driven through the same press paths the windows use. Only
# travel, watch, ack and transactions spend an action; the preferences are free.
purse 6000
trace
option music
option soundEffects
option reducedMotion
option theme void
option audio 0.65
trace
target tolme
travel
trace
